ion": "japan"}}, {"id": 676715, "date": 1676937600, "platform": 6, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 676709, "date": 748828800, "platform": 121, "y": 1993, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 757083, "date": 953769600, "platform": 120, "y": 2000, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 757084, "date": 962323200, "platform": 120, "y": 2000, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 757085, "date": 1182988800, "platform": 9, "y": 2007, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 757087, "date": 757296000, "platform": 150, "y": 1993, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 757086, "date": 1182988800, "platform": 38, "y": 2007, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 661657, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sce6jd.jpg"}, {"id": 661658, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sce6je.jpg"}, {"id": 661659, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sce6jf.jpg"}, {"id": 661660, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sce6jg.jpg"}], "slug": "cotton-fantastic-night-dreams", "storyline": "Darkness has fallen over the land. The secret to bringing the morning and restoring light is with the seven coloured Willow candies of Fairyland, each of which is currently held by an evil monster.\n\nThe fairy Silk leaves Fairyland to seek help, and comes across the powerful witch Cotton. Cotton has little interest in saving the world, but does have a sweet tooth for Willow candies. Silk promises Cotton that if she gathers all of the Willows, they will turn into a giant Willow.", "summary": "Cotton: Fantastic Night Dreams is a scrolling shooter arcade game, released on Sega's Sega System 16B Arcade system board in 1989. It is the first in the Cotton series of videogames.\n\nIt was ported to both the Sharp X68000 and the NEC TurboGrafx-CD in 1993. The TurboGrafx-CD version was released on Super CD-ROM and features an enhanced redbook audio soundtrack and voice acting on the Japanese release. The game was later ported to Sony PlayStation under the title Cotton Original in 1999. The PlayStation release combines the enhanced digital CD-ROM soundtrack of TurboGrafx-CD release and the gameplay/graphics of the original Arcade version. A version was ported to the Neo Geo Pocket Color in 2000. Due to hardware limitations the Neo Geo Pocket Color features less detailed graphics and sound compared to previous versions, however it is still a faithful version of the original in terms of gameplay.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cotton-fantastic-night-dreams", "videos": [{"id": 135598, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "w_8Bv83WEsE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w_8Bv83WEsE", "title": "Cotton (ARCADE)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w_8Bv83WEsE/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 4894, "name": "Cotton"}, {"id": 8193, "name": "SuperLite 1500"}]}